  "reason": "Revenue should exclude unearned consideration. The statement reports $28,211, but recognized revenue is $34,178 (satisfied obligations) minus $5,967 (returns), totaling $28,211. However, $4,099 in consideration for unsatisfied obligations must be deferred, reducing revenue. The $138 recorded as contract liabilities implies only $138 of the $4,099 was deferred, leaving $3,961 unaccounted. This violates ASC 606-10-25-23, which requires deferral of consideration for unsatisfied performance obligations."
